Feature: Pet Store API CRUD Operations\n\n  Scenario: Create a new pet successfully\n    Given the API endpoint is \"/v2/pet\"\n    When I send a POST request with the following data:\n      | name      | status   | category | tags      |\n      | Buddy     | available| Dog      | Friendly  |\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response body should contain the pet ID\n\n  Scenario: Retrieve an existing pet successfully\n    Given the API endpoint is \"/v2/pet/1234\"\n    When I send a GET request\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response body should contain the pet details\n\n  Scenario: Update an existing pet successfully\n    Given the API endpoint is \"/v2/pet\"\n    And I have the pet ID \"1234\"\n    When I send a PUT request with the following data:\n      | name      | status   | category | tags      |\n      | Buddy     | sold     | Dog      | Guardian  |\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response body should contain the updated pet details\n\n  Scenario: Delete an existing pet successfully\n    Given the API endpoint is \"/v2/pet/1234\"\n    When I send a DELETE request\n    Then the response status code should be 200\n    And the response body should confirm the pet is deleted